Third-Party Acknowledgments
================================================================================

Methodological inspiration (no source code or prompt text copied)
----------------------------------------------------------------
The directory layout pattern of bundling a Skill (skills/), a Python CLI
(src/), and reference documentation (references/ in their case, docs/ in ours)
was inspired by the public structure of:

  wuyoscar/gpt_image_2_skill
  https://github.com/wuyoscar/gpt_image_2_skill
  Licensed CC BY 4.0

NO source code, prompt text, README prose, or template content was copied from
that repository. This project's CLI surface, command set, default values,
template DSL, validators, and prompt language are independent reimplementations
based on OpenAI's official documentation and the project authors' own design.
The structural inspiration is treated as a public methodology, not as a
derivative work.

OpenAI documentation
--------------------
The correctness rules in this project (parameter ranges, valid sizes, quality
tiers, moderation defaults, transparent-background limitation, input_fidelity
deprecation, multilingual text rendering recommendations) were derived by
reading the public OpenAI documentation:

  - gpt-image-2 model page (https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-image-2)
  - Image Generation Guide (https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/image-generation)
  - Image-Generation Prompting Guide (OpenAI Cookbook)

We cite these sources but do not redistribute their prose. Where API parameter
names appear in this project (e.g. size, quality, moderation, n,
output_compression), they are factual API surface, not protected content.

